# CI-runnable self-contained integration subset (Phase 1).
#
# ctest cases that pass reliably in ISOLATION on a dedicated DDS domain — they
# stand up their own in-process DDS publisher+subscriber (or endpoint) and need
# NO external gRPC server (:5443), ROS graph, live DDS peer, or docker daemon.
# run_integration.sh runs exactly these in the CI integration lane on an
# isolated domain so they never cross-talk with the compose stack (domain 0).
#
# STRICT, anchored (^(...)$) for stability. The broader integration-tests.regex
# stays the UNIT-lane exclusion superset; tests that additionally need a service
# or that are timing-flaky are DEFERRED to a later phase, namely:
#   - GrpcTransport/GrpcProvider    : need a real gRPC server / timing-flaky
#   - MessageTransmitter *ROS        : need a ROS graph
#   - ConcreteEndpoint *_TC001       : need a live DDS peer
#   - ADSWManager Initialize/Start   : create a real DDS participant
#   - ContainerDockerCompose *_IT0   : need a docker daemon
#   - LifecycleAdswIntegrationTest   : forks a simulator subprocess → flaky abort
#   - DDSProtocol *_with_reader/writer : real reader/writer create-delete → flaky
#   - VssSubscription / OtamActor F012 : timer/thread timing
# Do NOT add a test here until it passes repeated isolated runs.
#
# Composition (29): ConcreteEndpoint 25 · ROSDiscovery 3 · MessageTransmitter 1
^(ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.AdswServiceStatusEndPoint_OnDataAvailable|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.GetServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_ReadFail|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.GetServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.GetServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC02|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.GetServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC03|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.LifecycleDiagReportEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.LifecycleDiagReportEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.NotifyServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.NotifyServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_ReadFail|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.NotifyServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpoint_OnDataAvailable|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.SetServiceModeEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_ReadFail|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.SetServiceModeEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_ReadFail|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC02|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC03|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StopServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_ReadFail|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StopServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StopServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC02|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StopServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC03|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.UpdateServiceListEndPoint_OnDataAvailable|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.UpdateServiceListEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_ReadFail|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.UpdateServiceListEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC002|MessageTransmitterTest\.ForwardDeliveredMessage_TC003_ROSMessagePrefix|ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest\.InitializeAndFinalize|ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest\.OnDataAvailable_DirectCall_ReadFails|ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest\.OnDataAvailable_MultipleCalls|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StopServiceEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.GetServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.NotifyServiceStateEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.UpdateServiceListEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.SetServiceModeEndPoint_OnDataAvailable_TC001|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.NotifyServiceState_MultipleMessages|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.CtrlStartServiceEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.CtrlStopServiceEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.CtrlSetServiceModeEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.CtrlSetRecoveryPolicyEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.CtrlStartContainerEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.CtrlStopContainerEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StartContainerEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.StopContainerEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.SetRecoveryPolicyEndPoint_DispatchesCallback|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.NotifyContainerStateEndPoint_DispatchesCallback)$
